          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked whether the jury was instructed that finding predatory price cutting alone suffices for a Section\u202f2 violation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f1be196ff4b567ee51a1a182c0937e1dd7eaa54a5d85824f772cfb84d367a529",
