            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens later asked whether, given proof of monopoly power, intent, and anticompetitive acts, the anticompetitive act itself must constitute a Sherman Act violation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f1be196ff4b567ee51a1a182c0937e1dd7eaa54a5d85824f772cfb84d367a529",
