              "end": 47,
              "start": 47
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito questioned how Weyerhaeuser could satisfy the recoupment prong given its lack of market power and new mills entering the market."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f1be196ff4b567ee51a1a182c0937e1dd7eaa54a5d85824f772cfb84d367a529",
