            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether, without the Brooke Group approach, the jury should be asked to follow the instructions currently proposed in this case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f1be196ff4b567ee51a1a182c0937e1dd7eaa54a5d85824f772cfb84d367a529",
            "evidence_ids": [
